{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've wrecked another car. This time, your wealthy father, a real estate developer, isn't giving you new keys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He's giving you the keys to a dilapidated office building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cash. No mercy. No excuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <strong>Dream Office.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/77a5e3ec90ef60f069ceda056d1caf41.poster.avif?t=1772120030\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/77a5e3ec90ef60f069ceda056d1caf41.webm?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/77a5e3ec90ef60f069ceda056d1caf41.mp4?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Office of Dreams, you are thrown into the depths of office management. Your task is simple (in theory): renovate a neglected office building, rent out its rooms, keep the tenants happy, and turn chaos into profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, repair, furnish, and manage every square foot. Deal with damage, tenant requests, and daily disasters\u2014sometimes figuratively, sometimes quite literally fires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the building starts making money... maybe one day it will finally be yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Renovate, repair, repeat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/3dfd52961550ec7078ed9797af9dcca8.poster.avif?t=1772120030\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/3dfd52961550ec7078ed9797af9dcca8.webm?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/3dfd52961550ec7078ed9797af9dcca8.mp4?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get involved in practical management:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean up trash, wash floors, and restore neglected rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair walls, paint, tile, and furnish interiors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell useless junk to finance further repairs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn empty, broken spaces into functional offices</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision costs time and money \u2014 and bad choices come back to haunt you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage real office spaces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/4597fc9a483f3556e81dd5ae45163714.poster.avif?t=1772120030\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/4597fc9a483f3556e81dd5ae45163714.webm?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/4597fc9a483f3556e81dd5ae45163714.mp4?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From offices and conference rooms to restrooms, hallways, and service areas\u2014each area has its own role and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poor planning leads to dissatisfied tenants. Smart management builds reputation... and revenue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tenants with personality</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/b1d94b3f17bd2185b981e5c485f3b12a.poster.avif?t=1772120030\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/b1d94b3f17bd2185b981e5c485f3b12a.webm?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/b1d94b3f17bd2185b981e5c485f3b12a.mp4?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tenants aren't just numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They joke, dance, nap at work \u2014 and sometimes actually work. Every company has its own expectations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Required equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standards for comfort and cleanliness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quiet workspaces... or a place for after-work parties</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They love order\u2014and they love office parties even more. You can clean up the mess later... but sometimes chaos leaves something valuable behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep the building alive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/c50c2f75186c76ccb2420d878e33814b.poster.avif?t=1772120030\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/c50c2f75186c76ccb2420d878e33814b.webm?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/c50c2f75186c76ccb2420d878e33814b.mp4?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The office does not run itself:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix printers before someone throws them out the window</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain coffee machines\u2014productivity depends on it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to breakdowns, negligence, and emergencies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ignore problems for too long, they can turn into disasters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money does not print itself. Even if the printer really wants to.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire smart, earn daily</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive regular rental offers from companies looking for specific premises.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet their requirements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right tenants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance risk, reputation, and stable income</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day is a struggle for profit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The daily struggle for success</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/71a28cedc37ae7e1de515989f6801751.poster.avif?t=1772120030\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/71a28cedc37ae7e1de515989f6801751.webm?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/71a28cedc37ae7e1de515989f6801751.mp4?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work during the day, manage your spaces, rent premises, and keep everything running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain cleanliness, reputation, and functionality\u2014or pay the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because in office management, teamwork means: Everyone is responsible\u2014so no one is to blame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you turn a crumbling office building into a profitable business... or just another expensive life lesson?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The office of your dreams awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/053f2a148439b18a2e8c270a8d2e64c0.avif?t=1772120030\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First 100 Earned","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510970/0f8db74b1e28baa94c9ed9f4b0711af8ae9cb132.jpg"},{"name":"Big Money","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510970/b348e99acd0e2291f78a6dd91ba0b11801c009d9.jpg"},{"name":"Office Is Paying Off","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510970/b51819042311524f3f20ce8f7cc1c32b7745f71f.jpg"},{"name":"Office Tycoon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510970/e23e93e1334b659fd668ba5d81647810a799d386.jpg"},{"name":"Profitable Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510970/189f885bfaa01378de77cba1a64f178c5bb17914.jpg"},{"name":"Making It Work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510970/133719af146fa7623f7c3a84b05df31029a08899.jpg"},{"name":"Money Never Sleeps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510970/bce3d9ec83d9649b2449aa9dd66ec9659c390496.jpg"},{"name":"Maintenance Crew","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510970/e01143099058bed39369b963a1be885f0896423a.jpg"},{"name":"Never Breaks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510970/468ceeb80f0be8109b2e6c19580a84eeb6787715.jpg"},{"name":"Handyman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510970/a9d1bd31ddc3b809d289226e1f5c664beea142d6.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2510970?t=1772120030","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2510970?t=1772120030","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/466faa6b022953f53c5d083c97931bf4bb492ba0/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1772120030","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/466faa6b022953f53c5d083c97931bf4bb492ba0/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1772120030","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2615730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've wrecked another car. This time, your wealthy father, a real estate developer, isn't giving you new keys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He's giving you the keys to a dilapidated office building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cash. No mercy. No excuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <strong>Dream Office.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/77a5e3ec90ef60f069ceda056d1caf41.poster.avif?t=1772120030\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/77a5e3ec90ef60f069ceda056d1caf41.webm?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/77a5e3ec90ef60f069ceda056d1caf41.mp4?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Office of Dreams, you are thrown into the depths of office management. Your task is simple (in theory): renovate a neglected office building, rent out its rooms, keep the tenants happy, and turn chaos into profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, repair, furnish, and manage every square foot. Deal with damage, tenant requests, and daily disasters\u2014sometimes figuratively, sometimes quite literally fires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the building starts making money... maybe one day it will finally be yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Renovate, repair, repeat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/3dfd52961550ec7078ed9797af9dcca8.poster.avif?t=1772120030\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/3dfd52961550ec7078ed9797af9dcca8.webm?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/3dfd52961550ec7078ed9797af9dcca8.mp4?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get involved in practical management:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean up trash, wash floors, and restore neglected rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair walls, paint, tile, and furnish interiors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell useless junk to finance further repairs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn empty, broken spaces into functional offices</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision costs time and money \u2014 and bad choices come back to haunt you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage real office spaces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/4597fc9a483f3556e81dd5ae45163714.poster.avif?t=1772120030\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/4597fc9a483f3556e81dd5ae45163714.webm?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/4597fc9a483f3556e81dd5ae45163714.mp4?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From offices and conference rooms to restrooms, hallways, and service areas\u2014each area has its own role and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poor planning leads to dissatisfied tenants. Smart management builds reputation... and revenue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tenants with personality</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/b1d94b3f17bd2185b981e5c485f3b12a.poster.avif?t=1772120030\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/b1d94b3f17bd2185b981e5c485f3b12a.webm?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/b1d94b3f17bd2185b981e5c485f3b12a.mp4?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tenants aren't just numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They joke, dance, nap at work \u2014 and sometimes actually work. Every company has its own expectations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Required equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standards for comfort and cleanliness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quiet workspaces... or a place for after-work parties</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They love order\u2014and they love office parties even more. You can clean up the mess later... but sometimes chaos leaves something valuable behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep the building alive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/c50c2f75186c76ccb2420d878e33814b.poster.avif?t=1772120030\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/c50c2f75186c76ccb2420d878e33814b.webm?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/c50c2f75186c76ccb2420d878e33814b.mp4?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The office does not run itself:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix printers before someone throws them out the window</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain coffee machines\u2014productivity depends on it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to breakdowns, negligence, and emergencies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ignore problems for too long, they can turn into disasters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money does not print itself. Even if the printer really wants to.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire smart, earn daily</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive regular rental offers from companies looking for specific premises.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet their requirements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right tenants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance risk, reputation, and stable income</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day is a struggle for profit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The daily struggle for success</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/71a28cedc37ae7e1de515989f6801751.poster.avif?t=1772120030\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/71a28cedc37ae7e1de515989f6801751.webm?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510970/extras/71a28cedc37ae7e1de515989f6801751.mp4?t=1772120030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work during the day, manage your spaces, rent premises, and keep everything running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain cleanliness, reputation, and functionality\u2014or pay the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because in office management, teamwork means: Everyone is responsible\u2014so no one is to blame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you turn a crumbling office building into a profitable business... or just another expensive life lesson?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The office of your dreams awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a